Preset voice reference clips
============================

The speaker reference clips under voices/refs/, and the transcripts in
voices/manifest.json, are sourced from:

  ai4bharat/Rasa
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/ai4bharat/Rasa
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution: "Rasa" by AI4Bharat, used under CC-BY-4.0.

The clips are used unmodified (scripts/fetch_voices.py selects whole utterances
and never trims them, so each clip still matches its transcript).
